{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T01:53:53.106Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8fcf1176eceedef40be11ce4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-998juj","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","lineage:pm-xp7ldt","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-998juj+pm-xp7ldt+pm-zi34i1","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-998juj","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","lineage:pm-xp7ldt","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-22T01:53:53.105Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implemented on branch fix/sdk-admission-scope-identity. The scope store in src/sdk/runtime.ts is now a record of the physical tracker root (realpath, or the resolved spelling before the directory exists) and the activated runtime, instead of a boolean. One helper, runUnderOpenExtensionScope, decides every nested entry: runAction, runWithActiveExtensions without its own cwd, runInActiveExtensionScope and the PmClient item-transaction context. Same root: the scope is reused and the nested call receives the activated runtime, so a nested extension action dispatches (before, a nested dispatch got no runtime and answered 'Unsupported native pm action'). Another root: that tracker's extensions are activated in fresh request-local registries under the gate slot the open scope already holds, and the caller's registrations are back when the nested call returns. runAction now publishes the scope its dispatch holds, which removes the wait described in the second comment: a command dispatched with an explicit cwd can call runInActiveExtensionScope, runWithActiveExtensions and a nested runAction for its tracker. A nested disabled scope is bound to the root it names. Left as documented behaviour: a nested runWithActiveExtensions that passes its own cwd still asks for exclusive use of the process working directory. Proof: tests/unit/sdk/extension/scope-tracker-identity.spec.ts (4 cases); all four fail on the previous runtime, two of them by timing out on the activation gate."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T01:53:53.106Z"}],"before_hash":"11898ca4edbbe0e3f21d59a3bb41adb479417864a043c01fd4a32250a431c6a3","after_hash":"84be1d08e89445078b2147f2b7d5e34fb5cd8ea38d07fd78275c90c8ba42f1f5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"5095f2dc08815ebd027336ef36a8534de18cd7850e98d1896f4405619130c76f"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T02:20:49.482Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8fcf1176eceedef40be11ce4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-998juj","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","lineage:pm-xp7ldt","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-998juj+pm-xp7ldt+pm-zi34i1","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-998juj","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","lineage:pm-xp7ldt","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T02:20:49.482Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/extension/scope-tracker-identity.spec.ts","scope":"project","provenance":{"author":"harness:claude-code","created_at":"2026-11-22T02:20:49.430Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"fix/sdk-admission-scope-identity"}}]}],"before_hash":"84be1d08e89445078b2147f2b7d5e34fb5cd8ea38d07fd78275c90c8ba42f1f5","after_hash":"4eae63ec85bdddb4dc4cb06e2f87f7e278a7c6f4655abcda0b220ce841e7e11b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f65ceb50953f4cbe6f4358e1ce3e1c0aa7adab7aa09dc07bc297019b4fdd9468"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.093Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-fable-5-2","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8fcf1176eceedef40be11ce4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-fable-5-2","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"medium","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-l6wdvh","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","release:pm-998juj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-l6wdvh+pm-xp7ldt+pm-zi34i1","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-l6wdvh","claim:pm-xp7ldt","claim:pm-zi34i1","release:pm-998juj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.330","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.093Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"First Codex review (gpt-6.2-sol, xhigh) of the branch, findings on the scope change, each verified and fixed in the follow-up commit. (1) An AsyncLocalStorage scope record stays visible to timers and promises its callback left behind, after the gate slot is released: the record now carries a live flag that is cleared when the callback settles, and an expired scope is treated as absent. (2) A nested call with noExtensions under the scope's own tracker inherited the caller's extensions once runAction published its scope: it now runs in empty registries. (3) A nested runAction with an explicit cwd resolved the tracker from that directory but never entered it: a cwd other than the current directory is refused with reason nested_cwd_unavailable, for runAction and runWithActiveExtensions alike, which also replaces the wait documented in the previous comment. (4) With a relative cwd and a relative path, the scope recorded one tracker and activation (after chdir) resolved another: the cwd is resolved to an absolute path once and the resolved root is the one activated. (5) The PmClient preview path activated another tracker outside the configuration-only settings wrapper: nested activation now runs inside it. The spec grew to 7 cases."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-22T03:03:50.093Z"}],"before_hash":"4eae63ec85bdddb4dc4cb06e2f87f7e278a7c6f4655abcda0b220ce841e7e11b","after_hash":"357cb45ff9e119400faa6976b8ebd37a64545c9e71c3fe7a172c88067a995a5a","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"dac7afc0c6c75bfebe7a0b9b604793cab488d2f05fb7d8a4f80585d7e24e4414"}
